"            working on what and when. It centralizes appointments in a visual layout, helping grooming teams stay coordinated,\n"
"            avoid overlaps, and quickly adapt to schedule changes throughout the day."
msgstr ""
"Modul Koledar zagotavlja jasen pregled vseh terminov nege v realnem času, "
"zato je enostavno videti, kdo je\n"
"            zadolžen za kaj in kdaj. Termine centralizira v vizualni "
"postavitvi ter negovalnim ekipam pomaga ohranjati usklajenost,\n"
"            preprečevati prekrivanja in se čez dan hitro prilagajati "
"spremembam urnika."

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Inventory application gives grooming businesses full visibility over the products they sell and consume daily.\n"
"            It tracks stock movements in real time, ensuring essential supplies such as shampoos or accessories are always\n"
"            available when needed."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Inventar podjetjem za nego živali omogoča popoln pregled nad "
"izdelki, ki jih prodajajo in dnevno porabljajo.\n"
"            V realnem času spremlja premike zalog ter zagotavlja, da so "
"osnovne potrebščine, kot so šamponi ali dodatki, vedno\n"
"            na voljo, ko jih potrebujejo."

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Pets application allows groomers to maintain detailed profiles for every animal they care for, shifting the\n"
"            focus from transactions to long-term pet care. Each profile stores essential information such as breed, size,\n"
"            behavior notes, and grooming history, enabling consistent and personalized service at every visit."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Pets negovalcem omogoča vzdrževanje podrobnih profilov za vsako "
"žival, za katero skrbijo, s čimer se\n"
"            poudarek s transakcij preusmeri na dolgoročno skrb za hišne "
"ljubljenčke. Vsak profil vsebuje bistvene informacije, kot so pasma, "
"velikost,\n"
"            opombe o vedenju in zgodovina nege, kar omogoča dosledno in "
"prilagojeno storitev ob vsakem obisku."

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Purchase application enables users to quickly send requests for quotations, compare vendor prices, and confirm\n"
"            purchases that are tracked in the Inventory application."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Nabava uporabnikom omogoča hitro pošiljanje zahtev za ponudbe, "
"primerjavo cen dobaviteljev in potrjevanje\n"
"            nakupov, ki se spremljajo v aplikaciji Inventar."

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Sales module acts as the commercial bridge between grooming services and"
" payment."
msgstr ""
"Modul Prodaja deluje kot poslovni most med storitvami negovanja in plačilom."

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Sales module helps grooming businesses formalize services into clear, structured orders before payment. It\n"
"            allows groomers to define what was provided during a session, add optional treatments or products, and ensure\n"
"            pricing is transparent and consistent across customers."
msgstr ""
"Modul Prodaja pomaga salonom za nego hišnih ljubljenčkov oblikovati storitve "
"v jasna, strukturirana naročila pred plačilom. Omogoča\n"
"            negovalcem, da določijo, kaj je bilo zagotovljeno med obiskom, "
"dodajo neobvezne tretmaje ali izdelke ter zagotovijo\n"
"            pregledne in dosledne cene za vse stranke."

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_grooming_service
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These services are ideal for routine upkeep, managing shedding, and keeping "
"your pet’s coat in top condition. From the very first “puppy’s groom” to "
